<p>Hi <%= @first_name %>!</p>

<p>You've been invited to register for Hack Club's <strong><%= @event_name %></strong>. Complete your information and required signatures to confirm your attendance.</p>

<% if @event_dates.present? || @location.present? %>
  <p>
    <% if @event_dates.present? %><strong>Dates:</strong> <%= @event_dates %><br><% end %>
    <% if @location.present? %><strong>Location:</strong> <%= @location %><% end %>
  </p>
<% end %>

<% if @registration_deadline.present? %>
  <p><strong>Complete your registration by <%= @registration_deadline %>.</strong></p>
<% end %>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= mail_button "Complete your registration in Attend", @onboarding_url %>
</p>

<p><strong>What to have ready</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Your contact details and date of birth.</li>
  <li>A clear photo of your face for event identification.</li>
  <li>Any health, dietary, accessibility, or support information the event team should know.</li>
  <% if @travel_required %><li>Your travel details, including bookings you already know.</li><% end %>
  <% if @accommodation_required %><li>Your accommodation requirements.</li><% end %>
  <% if @guardian_requirement == :minor %>
    <li>Your guardian contact details. After you submit, your guardian will receive a separate invitation to provide their details and required signatures.</li>
  <% elsif @guardian_requirement == :unknown_age %>
    <li>If you'll be under 18 when <%= @event_name %> starts, your guardian contact details. After you submit, your guardian will receive a separate invitation to provide their details and required signatures.</li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>You can save your progress, leave Attend, and sign back in later to resume your registration.</p>

<p>Use the Hack Club Account connected to the email address that received this invitation. If you use a different account or the link expires, email <%= mail_to @support_email %> or reply to this email for help.</p>
